    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...doing a thing includes making an instrument.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Doing a thing includes making an instrument.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) To avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...then, despite the repeal of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999...",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The provision takes things done by the old Chief Executive Officer and applies them to the new entity.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "takes",
      "cml:premiseText": "If a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Chief Executive Officer of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Chief Executive Officer of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Minister may determine that subitem (1) does not apply to certain things.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "determination",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is not a legislative instrument.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "A determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "not",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) A determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Chief Executive Officer of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Minister may determine that subitem (1) does not apply to certain things.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Minister may, in writing, determine..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-19-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...then, despite the repeal of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999...",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Subitems (1) and (2) are part of a larger provision.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "subitem",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) If a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Chief Executive Officer..."
    },
